  "ld_begin": "Start or attach to a rolling delivery task with the full objective and one first usable milestone; production starts immediately. After delivery, append one next_milestone with the current plan_revision when no pending milestone remains. Use estimates to revise timing, or revise_milestone with received feedback_ids and a reason to update the pending version from user conversation. Each mutation is separate. Times are elapsed from task start. Revisions preserve delivered snapshots and original target times. Only the user can enlarge the total budget.",
